.TH "sddm-greeter" "1" "May 2014" "sddm 0.21.0" "sddm"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sddm-greeter \- sddm display manager greeter
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
sddm\-greeter [OPTIONS...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
sddm is a display and login manager based on Qt technologies.
.sp
Using QtQuick and QML, designers are given the ability to
easily create pleasant, modern looking interfaces for sddm.
.sp
sddm\-greeter is an auxiliary process that displays the greeter, a graphical
user interface to perform the authentication and select the session to run.
.sp
It is launched by the sddm daemon, end users are not meant to run it.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-theme \fIPATH\fP
Specify theme full path.
.TP
.B \-\-socket \fINAME\fP
Specify the socket used to communicate with sddm daemon.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B  \-\-test\-mode
Start greeter in test mode.
.TP
.B  \-\-help\fP,\fB  \-h
Show help message and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fB/usr/lib/sddm/sddm.conf.d\fP
System configuration directory
.TP
.B \fB/etc/sddm.conf.d\fP
Local configuration directory
.TP
.B \fB/etc/sddm.conf\fP
Local configuration file for compatibility
.TP
.B \fB/usr/share/sddm/themes\fP
Where sddm looks for themes
.UNINDENT
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBsddm\fP(1), \fBsddm.conf\fP(5)
.sp
The full documentation for sddm is available at \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:sddm/\:sddm>
